{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QRRZd5Nn4g53Hz1HP9mEmX","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tvoid padata_do_serial(struct padata_priv *padata)\n2\t{\n3\t\tstruct parallel_data *pd = padata->pd;\n4\t\tint hashed_cpu = padata_cpu_hash(pd, padata->seq_nr);\n5\t\tstruct padata_list *reorder = per_cpu_ptr(pd->reorder_list, hashed_cpu);\n6\t\tstruct padata_priv *cur;\n7\t\tstruct list_head *pos;\n8\t\n9\t\tspin_lock(&reorder->lock);\n10\t\t/* Sort in ascending order of sequence number. */\n11\t\tlist_for_each_prev(pos, &reorder->list) {\n12\t\t\tcur = list_entry(pos, struct padata_priv, list);\n13\t\t\tif (cur->seq_nr < padata->seq_nr)\n14\t\t\t\tbreak;\n15\t\t}\n16\t\tlist_add(&padata->list, pos);\n17\t\tspin_unlock(&reorder->lock);\n18\t\n19\t\t/*\n20\t\t * Ensure the addition to the reorder list is ordered correctly\n21\t\t * with the trylock of pd->lock in padata_reorder.  Pairs with smp_mb\n22\t\t * in padata_reorder.\n23\t\t */\n24\t\tsmp_mb();\n25\t\n26\t\tpadata_reorder(pd);\n27\t}\n28\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"07062c8d-9fd8-4060-88e0-53e67c49b6e9","uuid":"8dec8734-1deb-4ec8-bfee-d6d9f76bd33b","timestamp":"2026-11-19T23:45:27.099Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/yangkaiyan/Desktop/EECS4080/blind-run/samples/s009.c","content":"void padata_do_serial(struct padata_priv *padata)\n{\n\tstruct parallel_data *pd = padata->pd;\n\tint hashed_cpu = padata_cpu_hash(pd, padata->seq_nr);\n\tstruct padata_list *reorder = per_cpu_ptr(pd->reorder_list, hashed_cpu);\n\tstruct padata_priv *cur;\n\tstruct list_head *pos;\n\n\tspin_lock(&reorder->lock);\n\t/* Sort in ascending order of sequence number. */\n\tlist_for_each_prev(pos, &reorder->list) {\n\t\tcur = list_entry(pos, struct padata_priv, list);\n\t\tif (cur->seq_nr < padata->seq_nr)\n\t\t\tbreak;\n\t}\n\tlist_add(&padata->list, pos);\n\tspin_unlock(&reorder->lock);\n\n\t/*\n\t * Ensure the addition to the reorder list is ordered correctl